WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.568
This fictional colleague says an AI draft could misrepresent her expertise.

00:00:04.568 --> 00:00:08.721
The response, everyone must adapt, does not explore the concern.

00:00:08.721 --> 00:00:12.458
Neither does asking, why are you afraid of progress?

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:16.196
That question assumes a cause and judges the person.

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:21.594
Replace it with, what would you like us to understand about this change?

00:00:21.594 --> 00:00:24.916
Then ask about the review control she needs.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:34.883
Prepare five questions for your own project: learn the role, invite a concern, invite what may become harder, check your summary and explore support.

00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:37.375
Two of these directly invite concerns.

00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:41.527
Ask one at a time and leave room for correction.

00:00:41.527 --> 00:00:45.265
You can acknowledge disagreement while naming an approval limit.

00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:48.587
Respectful listening does not require an unsupported promise.
